{"total_count": 10, "incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/352", "id": 4912702945, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM7zC_qW", "number": 352, "title": "Fix ValueError in metric()/scientific() with precision 0", "user": {"login": "santhreal", "id": 64453045, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDUzMDQ1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64453045?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal", "html_url": "https://github.com/santhreal", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/santhreal/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2026-07-17T15:34:55Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:41:12Z", "closed_at": "2026-07-28T07:50:59Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/352", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/352", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/352.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/352.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "`metric(value, precision=0)` raises `ValueError: Format specifier missing precision` when the magnitude falls back to `scientific()`, because `metric` calls `scientific(value, precision - 1)`, so precision `0` becomes `-1` and builds an invalid format spec `\"{:.-1e}\"`. `scientific(value, -1)` directly hits the same path.\n\n#159 fixed this for the non-scientific `metric` path; this covers the `scientific()` fallback it did not reach. `scientific` now clamps a negative precision to zero.\n\n```python\nimport humanize\nhumanize.metric(1e300, \"m\", 0)   # was: ValueError; now: \"1 x 10³⁰⁰m\"\nhumanize.scientific(1e300, -1)   # was: ValueError; now: \"1 x 10³⁰⁰\"\n```", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/352/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/308", "id": 4243719777, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM7RpJeE", "number": 308, "title": "Improve performance of `number.scientific`", "user": {"login": "hugovk", "id": 1324225, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjQyMjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1324225?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk", "html_url": "https://github.com/hugovk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 4034495678, "node_id": "LA_kwDOG9EFvM7weYS-", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/labels/changelog:%20Changed", "name": "changelog: Changed", "color": "af99e5", "default": false, "description": "For changes in existing functionality"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-04-11T08:11:46Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T21:03:25Z", "closed_at": "2026-05-16T20:57:47Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "MEMBER", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/308", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/308", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/308.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/308.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "Replace for loop with list comprehension.\r\n\r\nAnd add perflint to Ruff rules.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/308/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/313", "id": 4442210687, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM7bVeWT", "number": 313, "title": "Refactor: simplify `scientific()` and extract `_SUPERSCRIPT_MAP` constant", "user": {"login": "maayanmatsliah-tech", "id": 245869039, "node_id": "U_kgDODqep7w", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/245869039?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech", "html_url": "https://github.com/maayanmatsliah-tech", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/maayanmatsliah-tech/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 4034495678, "node_id": "LA_kwDOG9EFvM7weYS-", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/labels/changelog:%20Changed", "name": "changelog: Changed", "color": "af99e5", "default": false, "description": "For changes in existing functionality"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 5, "created_at": "2026-05-14T00:58:59Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-12T16:30:55Z", "closed_at": "2026-05-14T16:15:48Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/313", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/313", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/313.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/313.patch", "merged_at": "2026-05-14T16:15:48Z"}, "body": "Cool repo! I made a small cleanup to the scientific() function in number.py.\r\n\r\nI extracted the exponents dict as a module-level constant so it's not recreated on every function call. I also simplified the character mapping loop into a generator expression.\r\n\r\nI'm happy to make any changes if necessary. Hope this helps! \r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/313/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/315", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/315/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/315/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/315/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/315", "id": 4461244156, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM7cRWaB", "number": 315, "title": "Performance improvements: 1.07x - 8.4x", "user": {"login": "hugovk", "id": 1324225, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjQyMjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1324225?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk", "html_url": "https://github.com/hugovk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 4034495678, "node_id": "LA_kwDOG9EFvM7weYS-", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/labels/changelog:%20Changed", "name": "changelog: Changed", "color": "af99e5", "default": false, "description": "For changes in existing functionality"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2026-05-16T20:51:28Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T21:30:42Z", "closed_at": "2026-05-16T21:02:51Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "MEMBER", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/315", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/315", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/315.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/315.patch", "merged_at": "2026-05-16T21:02:51Z"}, "body": "With this benchmark script:\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Details</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom __future__ import annotations\r\n\r\nimport datetime as dt\r\nimport timeit\r\n\r\nimport humanize\r\n\r\n_WHEN = dt.datetime.now() - dt.timedelta(hours=3, minutes=27)\r\n_DELTA = dt.timedelta(days=2, hours=3, seconds=4)\r\n\r\nCASES = [\r\n    (\"ordinal(123)\",            lambda: humanize.ordinal(123)),\r\n    (\"apnumber(7)\",             lambda: humanize.apnumber(7)),\r\n    (\"intcomma(1_234_567_890)\", lambda: humanize.intcomma(1_234_567_890)),\r\n    (\"scientific(-1.234e-50)\",  lambda: humanize.scientific(-1.234e-50)),\r\n    (\"natural_list(4 items)\",   lambda: humanize.natural_list([\"one\", \"two\", \"three\", \"four\"])),\r\n    (\"naturaltime(3h27m ago)\",  lambda: humanize.naturaltime(_WHEN)),\r\n    (\"precisedelta(2d 3h 4s)\",  lambda: humanize.precisedelta(_DELTA)),\r\n]\r\n\r\nNUMBER = 200_000\r\nREPEAT = 10\r\nWARMUP = 100\r\n\r\n\r\ndef main() -> None:\r\n    print(f\"humanize: {humanize.__version__}\")\r\n    print(f\"{NUMBER:,} calls per round, {REPEAT} rounds\\n\")\r\n    print(f\"{'case':32s}  {'min ns':>10s}  {'median ns':>10s}\")\r\n    print(\"-\" * 56)\r\n    for name, fn in CASES:\r\n        for _ in range(WARMUP):\r\n            fn()\r\n        times = timeit.repeat(fn, number=NUMBER, repeat=REPEAT)\r\n        times.sort()\r\n        print(f\"{name:32s}  {min(times)/NUMBER*1e9:10.0f}  \"\r\n              f\"{times[len(times)//2]/NUMBER*1e9:10.0f}\")\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    main()\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n```\r\nhumanize: 4.15.0\r\n200,000 calls per round, 10 rounds\r\n\r\ncase                                  min ns   median ns\r\n--------------------------------------------------------\r\nordinal(123)                            3634        3673\r\napnumber(7)                             3587        3764\r\nintcomma(1_234_567_890)                 3287        3508\r\nscientific(-1.234e-50)                  1311        1329\r\nnatural_list(4 items)                    425         435\r\nnaturaltime(3h27m ago)                  2710        2726\r\nprecisedelta(2d 3h 4s)                  8964        9046\r\n``` \r\n```\r\nhumanize: 4.15.1.dev37\r\n200,000 calls per round, 10 rounds\r\n\r\ncase                                  min ns   median ns\r\n--------------------------------------------------------\r\nordinal(123)                             594         596\r\napnumber(7)                              429         439\r\nintcomma(1_234_567_890)                 1026        1514\r\nscientific(-1.234e-50)                   633         928\r\nnatural_list(4 items)                    323         466\r\nnaturaltime(3h27m ago)                  2528        2580\r\nprecisedelta(2d 3h 4s)                  8319        8521\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n| Function | 4.15.0 | PR | Speedup |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| `ordinal(123)` | 3634 ns | 594 ns | **6.1x** |\r\n| `apnumber(7)` | 3587 ns | 429 ns | **8.4x** |\r\n| `intcomma(1_234_567_890)` | 3287 ns | 1026 ns | **3.2x** |\r\n| `scientific(-1.234e-50)` | 1311 ns | 633 ns | **2.1x** |\r\n| `natural_list(4 items)` | 425 ns | 323 ns | **1.3x** |\r\n| `naturaltime(3h27m ago)` | 2710 ns | 2528 ns | **1.07x** |\r\n| `precisedelta(2d 3h 4s)` | 8964 ns | 8319 ns | **1.08x** |", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/315/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/