/api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/185", "id": 2269798636, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM5uDf5E", "number": 185, "title": "Add 'humanize' command-line interface", "user": {"login": "sakurai-youhei", "id": 721858, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTg1OA==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/721858?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei", "html_url": "https://github.com/sakurai-youhei", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sakurai-youhei/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2024-04-29T19:28:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-22T11:26:58Z", "closed_at": "2024-10-22T11:26:58Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/185", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/185", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/185.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/185.patch", "merged_at": null}, "body": "This PR adds 'humanize' command-line interface, which enables users to run `humanize` directly on the terminal.\r\n\r\n**Example of use**:\r\n```console\r\n$ humanize naturalsize 8589934592\r\n8.6 GB\r\n$ humanize naturalsize --binary 8589934592\r\n8.0 GiB\r\n$ echo 8589934592 | python -m humanize naturalsize --format \"%.3f\"\r\n8.590 GB\r\n$\r\n$ humanize --version\r\nhumanize 0.1.dev845\r\n$\r\n$ humanize --help\r\nusage: humanize [-h] [-v] FUNCTION ...\r\n\r\nPython humanize utilities\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  FUNCTION\r\n    apnumber     Converts an integer to Associated Press style.\r\n    clamp        Returns number with the specified format, clamped between floor and ceil.\r\n    fractional   Convert to fractional number.\r\n    intcomma     Converts an integer to a string containing commas every three digits.\r\n    intword      Converts a large integer to a friendly text representation.\r\n    metric       Return a value with a metric SI unit-prefix appended.\r\n    naturalsize  Format a number of bytes like a human readable filesize (e.g. 10 kB).\r\n    ordinal      Converts an integer to its ordinal as a string.\r\n    scientific   Return number in string scientific notation z.wq x 10ⁿ.\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help     show this help message and exit\r\n  -v, --version  show program's version number and exit\r\n$\r\n$ humanize naturalsize --help\r\nusage: humanize naturalsize [-h] [--locale LOCALE] [--binary] [--gnu] [--format FORMAT] [values ...]\r\n\r\npositional arguments:\r\n  values           Values to humanize. If not found, humanizes inputs from stdin.\r\n\r\noptions:\r\n  -h, --help       show this help message and exit\r\n  --locale LOCALE  Language name, e.g. `en_GB`.\r\n  --binary         If `True`, uses binary suffixes (KiB, MiB) with base 2**10 instead of 10**3. (default: `False`)\r\n  --gnu            If `True`, the binary argument is ignored and GNU-style (`ls -sh` style) prefixes are used (K, M) with the 2**10 definition. (default: `False`)\r\n  --format FORMAT  Custom formatter. (default: `%.1f`)\r\n```\r\n\r\nCloses #184\r\n\r\nChanges proposed in this pull request:\r\n\r\n* CLI for `humanize.filesize` and `humanize.number`.\r\n* `humanize.cli` package, which relies on argparse to keep the package dependencies free.\r\n* `humanize.__main__` module for `python -m humanize`.\r\n* Tests.\r\n\r\nNote: `humanize.time` is excluded from the scope because it's too hard to process arbitrary date & time inputs.", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/185/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "score": 1.0}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/202", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/202/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/202/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/202/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/202", "id": 2514674832, "node_id": "PR_kwDOG9EFvM56492G", "number": 202, "title": "Drop support for Python 3.8", "user": {"login": "hugovk", "id": 1324225, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjQyMjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1324225?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk", "html_url": "https://github.com/hugovk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/hugovk/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 4034495678, "node_id": "LA_kwDOG9EFvM7weYS-", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/labels/changelog:%20Changed", "name": "changelog: Changed", "color": "af99e5", "default": false, "description": "For changes in existing functionality"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2024-09-09T18:49:34Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-07T21:37:59Z", "closed_at": "2024-09-14T05:57:52Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "MEMBER", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "draft": false, "pull_request": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/pulls/202", "html_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/202", "diff_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/202.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/python-humanize/humanize/pull/202.patch", "merged_at": "2024-09-14T05:57:52Z"}, "body": "Python 3.8 is end-of-life next month:\r\n\r\n* https://devguide.python.org/versions/\r\n* https://peps.python.org/pep-0569/#lifespan", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/python-humanize/humanize/issues/202/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0,